The model data shipped in app/static/data/ (baseline, scenario deviations,
validation figures) is derived from MAKRO, the macroeconomic model of Denmark
developed by DREAM (https://github.com/DREAM-DK/MAKRO), which is released under
the MIT License, Copyright (c) DREAM. MAKROskop is an independent project and
is not affiliated with or endorsed by DREAM or the Danish Ministry of Finance.
